    title: "Scott Shapiro: what happens to legitimacy when law becomes code?",
    slug: "scott-shapiro-law-as-code-ai",
    summary: "The Yale philosopher of law argues that the real question artificial intelligence raises for law is not efficiency but power. Even when rule-based systems give the right answer, 'legal reasoning' becomes an appeal to authority once the reasoning can no longer be followed by a human.",
