    title: "This Day in Philosophy — 19 August: the death of Blaise Pascal",
    slug: "this-day-19-august-pascal",
    summary: "The mathematician, physicist and thinker Blaise Pascal died on 19 August 1662 at the age of thirty-nine. What survived was the notes for an unfinished book: the Pensées.",
